      "t": "In this scene at the restaurant pass, Chef Viktor Barinov hands over a dish for table five. Desperate to find money for his football bet before the match starts, Viktor tries to borrow tip money from Kostya. Listen to their hurried exchange in Russian first, and then we will examine each sentence.",
