    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now, let us examine the vocabulary and phrasing of this urgent kitchen interaction.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Шеф, давай уже быстрее заказ!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, hurry up the order already!' Kostya rushes the kitchen line during service.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Гость за пятым столиком ждёт.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The guest at table five is waiting.' Kostya highlights the demanding customer.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Всё готово, можешь забирать блюдо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything is ready, you can take the dish.' Viktor hands over the freshly prepared meal.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Отлично, несу в зал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Great, taking it to the dining room.' Kostya prepares to deliver the hot plate.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Стой, секунду, подожди меня здесь!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, one second, wait for me here!' Viktor halts the waiter before he can leave.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Шеф, мне надо сейчас работать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, I need to work right now.' Kostya points to his busy dining room duties.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Костя, скажи, как твои дела?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kostya, tell me, how are your affairs?' Viktor tries small talk to break the ice.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Нормально, чаевые сегодня хорошие.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fine, tips are good today.' Kostya mentions his successful shift at the tables.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Точно хорошие? Ты богатый человек!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Really good? You are a wealthy man!' Viktor flatters him with exaggerated compliments.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Мне просто занять немного нужно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just need to borrow a little.' Viktor makes his direct financial request.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Шеф, вы хотите мои чаевые?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, you want my tips?' Kostya reacts with protective disbelief.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Всего пару тысяч до утра!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Only a couple of thousand until morning!' Viktor begs for a temporary emergency loan.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Шеф, давай попозже поговорим!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, let us talk later!' Kostya makes a swift excuse and hurries away.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ладно, иди, но я вернусь!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
